Package: saecol2026
Type: Package
Title: SAE Colombia Migration 2026 Simulation Pipeline
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Luciano", "Perfetti Villa", email = "lucianopv@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("David", "Newhouse", role = "aut"))
Description: Design-based simulation drawing ECV 2024-style samples from the
    CNPV 2018 census frame, fitting small area estimation methods to each
    sample and scoring their point and uncertainty estimates against the
    census ground truth.
